[32m+[m[32m# 🕵️ AI-Powered Explainable Deepfake Detection System[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDetect whether an **image**, **video**, or **live webcam** stream is **REAL** or a **DEEPFAKE** — with confidence scores and visual **Grad-CAM** explanations of *why*.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA modular, production-style system built with **PyTorch, OpenCV, Streamlit, FastAPI, SQLite, and Docker**, suitable for a final-year B.Tech AI/ML project and placement portfolio.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## ✨ Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Capability | Description |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---|[m
[32m+[m[32m| 📷 **Image detection** | Upload JPG/PNG → face detection → crop → resize → inference → REAL/FAKE + confidence |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🎬 **Video detection** | Frame sampling → per-frame inference → **majority voting** + frame statistics |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 📹 **Real-time webcam** | Live bounding box, label, confidence, and FPS (desktop + in-browser) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🔥 **Explainable AI** | **Grad-CAM** heatmap overlay comparing original vs. model attention |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🗂️ **Prediction history** | Every result stored in **SQLite** (file, prediction, confidence, time, date) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 📊 **Dashboard** | Aggregate analytics (real/fake counts, avg confidence, avg latency) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🌐 **REST API** | **FastAPI** with auto-generated Swagger docs |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🐳 **Docker** | One-command deployment of API + UI via Docker Compose |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🔐 **User login** | Auth-gated UI (hashed passwords in SQLite) on Streamlit & Gradio |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🔊 **Audio (bonus)** | Voice-clone detection + audio/video score **fusion** (see `src/audio_*`) |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 🛡️ **AI Trust Score** | 0–100 authenticity score fusing face, temporal, lip-sync & texture signals |[m
[32m+[m[32m| 📄 **PDF report** | Exportable authenticity report (verdict, sub-scores, hash, recommendation) |[m
